[[0,1328622,0,2,0,2,"2016-10-06T01:06:25","Anson","",[],"<p>You know <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1Z1oMwS8phI\">that brutal stabbing in Germany</a> from a day or two ago? Well, it's always a talking point in defense of keeping our guns that &quot;you can't ban the knives&quot; or the semi-auto assault trucks for that matter. I would say that the muslim terrorist attacks in Europe and the US are perfect real life examples that could be used to say what would, in fact, happen if someone who wanted to commit a crime would do if they couldn't get a gun. The muslim attack in Paris where they shot all those people is also example (but with a gun, where guns are banned) and so on. So anyone who has detailed knowledge of different events could really structure that to fit a string, sound argument. This is unbelievable right now, it's like we nearly empirically proved a philosophy; which almost makes it not a philosophy anymore. AMERICA WINS AGAIN!</p>\n<p>TL;DR We now have very real evidence of what happens when criminals can't get guns. The brutality of that video really does help illustrate the point as well. It's game over for the opposition.</p>","Holy shit, you guys are going to love me. You know the second amendment, right? You know how people want to take it away...?","","politics"],[1,6494241,0,1,0,1,"2016-10-06T01:30:37","antiliberalsociety","",[],"<p>So, what exactly are you doing to make us love you? The NRA and several other organizations have already spread several stories in which guns saved lives. </p>\n<p><a href=\"http://www.breitbart.com/texas/2016/10/04/texas-store-employee-uses-ak-47-stop-4-armed-robbers/\">http://www.breitbart.com/texas/2016/10/04/texas-store-employee-uses-ak-47-stop-4-armed-robbers/</a> </p>"],[2,6494638,6494241,0,0,0,"2016-10-06T02:36:18","Anson","",[],"<p>I made my post under unstated assumption that the lefties are paying attention to the attacks in Europe, and given that there's been a long string of high-profile attacks recently and now this brutal one. And many of these attacks are being carried out with non-guns. I haven't really head anyone framing this in the way I did above. I'm strongly convinced there's something here for at least the people who were on the fence about the pro-second amendment. Of which, there are many (to quote Trump, ha!)..</p>"],[1,6494288,0,0,0,0,"2016-10-06T01:38:54","Ioxvm","",[],"<p>You are just now figuring this shit out? Well... congratulations?</p>\n<p>These things have been going on for years. Anyone at this point (and there are still a ton of them) that believe that gun control will do anything in this country useful has a massive load of cognitive dissonance going on. Facts are not part of their reality.</p>"],[1,6494368,0,0,0,0,"2016-10-06T01:50:01","Mediocrity","",[],"<p>We've had that empirical evidence for decades.</p>\n<p>But nobody reports on it cuz guns 'r bad, mmm'kay?</p>"]]
